<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharin forces have tightened their grip on the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces claim capture of Buurhakaba after heavy fighting in the Bay region, and fighters loyal to a former regional president have also seized Burhakaba. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is hosting regional talks in Egypt with Eritrea, Sudan and its own officials to coordinate security amid rising Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions. The federal government is deepening defence ties with Pakistan, seeking JF‑17 fighter jets and securing the release of four Pakistani sailors freed from Somali pirates. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOOW95azVxaFQ4QXpKOWFZbGx1bGVxQ2FCR3pVQ0VhellxblN6STRwYUlfQnR5cFo0NDNpcUo2S0I3NnVrUF9Xby1UeHV3ZnFxSTgwT2FCdWlzLTdTbXowcFRpUEUwOVZmcldIU3haVFJvRnNha3dkUmt3bXFUX2s3SDhiaVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQWWNDMlcyRzVWREZPdU5MUlNnUjYxMkRqNUxsZUJmU0Raek9rTi1Sa19BRVNneGZVRXhpUmhfVzJiMXVIbEs2dlVNM0Z1YmxjSGxUSmhjcHlGbEx5Y0VaaXNfTXA0MzhpZkd5WG1TeG1BaFo3cW81WUJ6N3VKOEhBWWdhR2ZMZXlETnpYRHFLZzhkX1ZuMjhXeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Boston Globe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNTTI3cWNTRTNWZTJqekhNUE9aNzBXdU5iQ0Q0YkNXT3V4U2pJWlFKcHBMWTNBazJrUC03cW0yZDFhb09oSElBc0dqbUR4R1ozaEExVjRHRFJtdXpYQ0VWaXZJbWZwVDkzOE1CcTlJVHczZ1h3YkhsdjcyVjIyRzBGYVJXa3c5WXZsVmpPakU0X3BlZ05xcXZueERVYlFoLXBKRFRwdUI2MjFKczVpZVRBNlVYSUIzaXRkTDdsTzhGSkpTTFhzRGpMbWg4YUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre